# Chrome extension: Manifest V2 is end-of-life. The Web Store no longer accepts
# MV2 and Chrome is removing support. A new/maintained extension must be MV3.
# @see docs/rules-authoring.md
id: CHROME-SEC-004
ilities: [analysability]
maturity: 3
title: Chrome extension still on Manifest V2 (end-of-life)
category: security
severity: error
engine: pattern
action: block
confidence: 0.9
target:
  filenames: manifest.json
  content_contains: manifest_version
patterns:
  - regex: \"manifest_version\"\s*:\s*2\b
    message: "manifest_version 2 is end-of-life and rejected by the Web Store. Migrate to MV3."
fix: "Migrate to Manifest V3 (service_worker background, action API, declarativeNetRequest)."
